{
  "schema_version": "effectslice-fg1-atom-registry.v1",
  "task_id": "AGENT-RA-02",
  "atoms": [
    {
      "atom_id": "a_440cf244c6e52acc",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 0
      },
      "rendered_text": "Implement `react_tool_loop_controller` through `solve(case)` for this bounded objective: Execute a bounded ReAct loop over deterministic tool fixtures with invalid-action feedback, observation accumulation, and final-answer termination.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "b3b15b2efc833c4ef64df488ab79f81306fdf455b2f351a00aa35bdd104b7207"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_377702a9917e9aae",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 1
      },
      "rendered_text": "Stay inside this mechanism boundary: ReAct tool-loop orchestration with supplied model emissions; model prompting and real web environments are excluded. Validate every required field before computing a result.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "2073b5892715b0dbb4557baedc66f5858535585861c97b02420b6ccaf8caba83"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_25ab8e9355a94965",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 2
      },
      "rendered_text": "Start at the registered initial state.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "c7b9d2391706c62c3cf891e31568fcff49f658d21224e5553b62636d2d25c817"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_8719295d4d028be9",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 3
      },
      "rendered_text": "A final state terminates without a tool call.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "f0e6339f6de541abe3534501be67da162336a98639ca957047d9592e1870c7c5"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_6867193c8221fc9f",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 4
      },
      "rendered_text": "An action state dispatches its named tool and records the exact observation.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "f8daeb269f27e3b767b2a13cc8ce7b0e0e20d47960dcd819c23c4318628f8a11"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_066d28dc520c2a5b",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 419,
        "byte_end": 519,
        "split_index": 5
      },
      "rendered_text": "Select the observation-specific successor or the default; distinguish missing tools and states.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "5eddbffb9c9ff14dad611a2df172da17a91eb778e32ad77bda82bf649c2d0515"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_31b91248da113c2d",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 6
      },
      "rendered_text": "Stop on completion or max steps and return status, final value, and trace.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "c235a77d93811c182fd6f05ea5a7253900d92f659724950d4f6856940b178e8a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_74f0e34c620f31d0",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 7
      },
      "rendered_text": "Treat these registered properties as hard contracts rather than soft preferences: tool_trace, observation_accumulation, bounded_retry, terminal_is_final.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "529259ae3021b41bb91287faa845d32a4678841ebcd27ff869e62f05355136d8"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_49a44d6ddcad5f20",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 8
      },
      "rendered_text": "Use only quantities present in the case payload. Do not call a language model, network service, random generator, wall clock, or environment-dependent resource.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "bb651964decf660706e6b02a72268f4df8c9cfde1515a5b2325af47505fa92df"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_ea15fbb3353a9976",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 9
      },
      "rendered_text": "Preserve every source identifier needed to audit the decision, and compute aggregate values from the returned primitive decisions rather than from a second approximation.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "d6b67e3cd654a61b271920e037938dc07550072b2334416f32ed86b0bd787362"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_06a857688013cce7",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 10
      },
      "rendered_text": "Do not mutate the input. All ranking and traversal ties use the source position or identifier specified above; never depend on hash-map iteration.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "67186a43fcf39ec73132c8ab7ad1387670a6fd7d5e511075a50faf835be9e19a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_6d6bc37a42308d9f",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "651934a5ebb8ed99be7efcc9d17d115d8f0966b340fe2e73069df048fb1fd68c",
        "byte_start": 536,
        "byte_end": 618,
        "split_index": 11
      },
      "rendered_text": "Return only JSON-serializable values with the exact named fields. Raise ValueError for an infeasible or structurally invalid case instead of silently repairing it.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "5f164e6574e6f249d67514f65fc480435c9b737c31ea45311cd04552b1d13fcb"
    }
  ]
}
